## Summary

The migration has three phases.

## Phases

- **Phase 1** — freeze writes
  - announce the window
  - snapshot the database
- **Phase 2** — copy data
- **Phase 3** — cut over

| Phase | Owner | Days |
|-------|-------|------|
| 1     | Ops   | 1    |
| 2     | Data  | 3    |

